#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "499052"
msgid "………………\n…………\n……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "499452"
msgid "Mm……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "499716"
msgid "When I greeted her, she gave me a soft,\nbut happy-looking smile in return."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500016"
msgid "I said to lighten things up.\nHer initial murmurs were overdramatic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500104"
msgid "Huh…… oh, no,\nwhat kind of face was I making……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500156"
msgid "……but it wasn't an exaggeration.\nFor someone like me, it was……\nsomething amazing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500260"
msgid "B-by the way, thank you very much.\nNot only did you save me,\nyou even stayed to look after me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500452"
msgid "Ah……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500468"
msgid "Ahhh, I'm fine, I'm fine, so it's okay!\nIf anything, it'll make my fever even worse…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "500556"
msgid "At #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's insistence, I move my hand away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501092"
msgid "Pure and honest gratitude seems to really warm one's heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "501940"
msgid "Now…… um, may I ask something as well?\nHas anything, um……\nout of the ordinary happened?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "502220"
msgid "Yep.\nNothing out-of-the-ordinary.\nNot one new thing happened."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "502928"
msgid "This is pretty lonely, isn't it?\n……I've, only realized it just now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "503004"
msgid "And yet, Senpai still managed to notice me……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "503164"
msgid "Why did all of the students ignore #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "503320"
msgid "It wasn't long before the last bell to leave school rang."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516656"
msgid "Talking to you now,\nI'm just like text on the screen.\nSo this won't go over very well, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516760"
msgid "A-ahhhh…!\nS-s-stop, Senpai!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516932"
msgid "J-just how thoughtless and reckless\ncan you be, Senpai!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "516992"
msgid "This can't… be happening…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517212"
msgid "…………what should I do?\nWhat do I do? How do I save #[him][her]#?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517372"
msgid "I don't know. I just don't know.\nWhat do I want to do――?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522104"
msgid "…are you okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522124"
msgid "A young girl's voice wakes me up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522396"
msgid "You're, erm… #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF, yes?\nYou made it past the 5th Round.\nCongratulations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522592"
msgid "I thank her and get out of the bed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522736"
msgid "…are you okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522756"
msgid "A young girl's voice wakes me up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523112"
msgid "Without a Servant…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523352"
msgid "But―― a Servant.\nI wonder, who in the world is my Servant?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523512"
msgid "U-um, it should be either\na #C236196003Saber#CDEF, #C236196003Archer#CDEF, or #C236196003Caster#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523896"
msgid "I thank her and get out of the bed."
msgstr ""

